    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see, so you're saying the oil interests were more important than the security concerns? it just seems like a pretty massive trade-off to make—sacrificing a whole country's democracy just to keep prices stable or stop the soviets. do u think there was any way the us could've handled it differently that wouldn't have caused all that long-term resentment?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
